# An allowlist (W3-11, ADR-046): everything is excluded, then only the code the API and the UI run is added back.
# So .env, certs/, data/, .git and the virtual environments can never reach the image, whatever their names.
# tests/test_deploy.py checks that every package the runtime imports is listed.
*
!agent/
!api/
!config/
!core/
!ingest/
!retrieval/
!tools/
!ui/
!.streamlit/
!pyproject.toml
!requirements.txt
!requirements-dev.txt
!constraints-docker.txt
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
